<title>USA: Amoco in research agreement.</title>
<headline>Amoco in research agreement.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amoco Corp, the oil and natural gas producer, said Monday it has signed a cooperative research and development agreement with Sandia National Laboratory in Albuquerque, New Mexico, to develop advanced materials for the petrochemical indusrtry.</p>
<p>The materials include energy-efficient and environmentally-friendly hydrocarbon separations, Amoco said.</p>
<p>The U.S. Department of Energy's office of Industrial Technology awarded about $1.3 million for the research agreement for the first three years, and Amoco said it will spend the same amount to support the research project.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
